Subject: [PATCH] VLC FEL: the 3D MVC decoder of the S928X, hardware or
 software (Video settings); the frame packing mode without a known rate

---
 .../java/org/videolan/resources/VLCOptions.kt | 11 +++++++++++
 .../ui/preferences/PreferencesVideo.kt        |  4 +++-
 .../vlc-android/res/xml/preferences_video.xml |  7 +++++++
 .../vlc/gui/preferences/PreferencesVideo.kt   |  4 +++-
